{"seq":1,"slug":"aria-roles-properties","title":"ARIA 角色、状态与属性实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/aria-roles-properties","wordCount":1079,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"aria-角色-状态与属性实战\">ARIA 角色、状态与属性实战</h1><p>WAI-ARIA（Accessible Rich Internet Applications）是为动态 Web 内容和自定义控件提供语义补充的规范。它的核心价值在于：当原生 HTML 元素无法表达组件的角色或状态时，ARIA 属性让可访问性树获得正确信息。但 ARIA 的第一规则是「如果能用原生 HTML 实现，就不要用 ARIA」——滥用 ARIA 比不用更糟糕，因为它只修改语义层而不附带任何行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ARIA 规范定义三类属性，它们共同构成辅助技术理解自定义控件的语义层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[WAI-ARIA 属性体系] --&gt; B[Roles 角色]&#10;    A --&gt; C[States 状态]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Properties 属性]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Widget Roles: button, checkbox, tab...]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Document Structure: heading, list, table...]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Landmark Roles: navigation, main, banner...]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[Abstract Roles: 不直接使用]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[aria-expanded]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[aria-checked]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[aria-selected]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[aria-disabled]&#10;    C --&gt; C5[aria-hidden]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[aria-label / aria-labelledby]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[aria-describedby]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[aria-controls]&#10;    D --&gt; D4[aria-haspopup]&#10;    D --&gt; D5[aria-live]\">graph TD\n    A[WAI-ARIA 属性体系] --&gt; B[Roles 角色]\n    A --&gt; C[States 状态]\n    A --&gt; D[Properties 属性]\n    B --&gt; B1[Widget Roles: button, checkbox, tab...]\n    B --&gt; B2[Document Structure: heading, list, table...]\n    B --&gt; B3[Landmark Roles: navigation, main, banner...]\n    B --&gt; B4[Abstract Roles: 不直接使用]\n    C --&gt; C1[aria-expanded]\n    C --&gt; C2[aria-checked]\n    C --&gt; C3[aria-selected]\n    C --&gt; C4[aria-disabled]\n    C --&gt; C5[aria-hidden]\n    D --&gt; D1[aria-label / aria-labelledby]\n    D --&gt; D2[aria-describedby]\n    D --&gt; D3[aria-controls]\n    D --&gt; D4[aria-haspopup]\n    D --&gt; D5[aria-live]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ARIA 五大使用规则</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则一：不要用 ARIA</td>\n<td>能用原生 HTML 实现就用原生</td>\n<td>优先 <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> 而非 <code>&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot;&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则二：不要改变原生语义</td>\n<td>除非绝对必要</td>\n<td>不给 <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> 加 <code>role=&quot;tab&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则三：所有交互 ARIA 控件必须键盘可用</td>\n<td>ARIA 只改语义不加行为</td>\n<td><code>role=&quot;button&quot;</code> 需要手动加 <code>tabindex</code> 和键盘事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则四：不要隐藏可聚焦元素</td>\n<td><code>aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;</code> 不能用于可聚焦元素</td>\n<td>隐藏时同时确保不在 Tab 序列中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则五：交互元素必须有 accessible name</td>\n<td>所有可操作控件需可计算名称</td>\n<td>图标按钮必须有 <code>aria-label</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"角色的正确使用\">角色的正确使用</h2><p><strong>Landmark Roles</strong> 定义页面的宏观结构区域。屏幕阅读器用户通过 landmark 列表快速导航，等同于视力正常用户的「一目了然看到页面布局」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;header&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 隐含 role=&quot;banner&quot; --&gt;&#10;  &lt;nav aria-label=&quot;主导航&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- role=&quot;navigation&quot; + 名称区分 --&gt;&#10;    ...&#10;  &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;/header&gt;&#10;&lt;main&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- role=&quot;main&quot;，每页只有一个 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;section aria-labelledby=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- 有 accessible name 时变为 role=&quot;region&quot; --&gt;&#10;    &lt;h2 id=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;产品列表&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;  &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;/main&gt;&#10;&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;相关推荐&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- role=&quot;complementary&quot; --&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;&#10;&lt;footer&gt;&lt;!-- 隐含 role=&quot;contentinfo&quot; --&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 隐含 role=\"banner\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主导航\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- role=\"navigation\" + 名称区分 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- role=\"main\"，每页只有一个 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">section</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"section-title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- 有 accessible name 时变为 role=\"region\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"section-title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>产品列表&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">section</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">aside</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"相关推荐\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- role=\"complementary\" --></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">aside</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 隐含 role=\"contentinfo\" --></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Widget Roles</strong> 用于自定义交互控件。使用时必须同步实现所有预期行为——ARIA 不提供任何功能实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 自定义开关：需手动实现聚焦、Space 切换、状态同步 --&gt;&#10;&lt;span&#10;  role=&quot;switch&quot;&#10;  tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&#10;  aria-checked=&quot;false&quot;&#10;  aria-label=&quot;深色模式&quot;&#10;  onkeydown=&quot;handleKeyDown(event)&quot;&#10;  onclick=&quot;toggle()&quot;&#10;&gt;&#10;  &lt;span class=&quot;track&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thumb&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 自定义开关：需手动实现聚焦、Space 切换、状态同步 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"switch\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  aria-checked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"深色模式\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onkeydown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleKeyDown</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onclick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toggle</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"track\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"thumb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>与之对比，原生 <code>&lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot;&gt;</code> 自带所有这些行为——这就是规则一的工程意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态管理的关键模式\">状态管理的关键模式</h2><p>ARIA 状态是动态的，必须随组件交互实时更新。遗忘更新状态是最常见的 ARIA bug：</p>\n<p><strong>展开/折叠模式（Disclosure）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;button aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; aria-controls=&quot;panel-1&quot;&gt;显示详情&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;div id=&quot;panel-1&quot; hidden&gt;详情内容...&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-expanded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-controls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"panel-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>显示详情&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"panel-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>详情内容...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>当用户点击按钮时，JavaScript 需要同步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>切换 <code>aria-expanded</code> 为 <code>&quot;true&quot;</code></li>\n<li>移除面板的 <code>hidden</code> 属性</li>\n<li>按钮文本可选择性更新（如改为「隐藏详情」）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>选中状态模式：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 单选组：aria-checked 只能有一个 true --&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;radiogroup&quot; aria-label=&quot;排序方式&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;div role=&quot;radio&quot; aria-checked=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;最新&lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;div role=&quot;radio&quot; aria-checked=&quot;false&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;最热&lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;div role=&quot;radio&quot; aria-checked=&quot;false&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;推荐&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 单选组：aria-checked 只能有一个 true --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"radiogroup\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"排序方式\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"radio\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-checked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>最新&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"radio\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-checked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>最热&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"radio\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-checked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>推荐&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>tabindex</code> 的配合使用——选中项 <code>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</code> 进入 Tab 序列，未选中项 <code>tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;</code> 仅通过箭头键可达（roving tabindex 模式）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aria-live-区域-动态内容播报\">aria-live 区域：动态内容播报</h2><p>当页面内容在非用户操作触发下更新时（如实时消息、表单验证结果、加载状态），屏幕阅读器默认不会朗读变化。<code>aria-live</code> 区域解决此问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 表单验证反馈 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;error-message&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- JavaScript 动态插入错误信息，屏幕阅读器会在当前操作结束后朗读 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 紧急通知 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 等同于 aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; + aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;，立即打断当前朗读 --&gt;&#10;  系统将在 5 分钟后维护&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 加载状态 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-busy=&quot;true&quot;&gt;正在加载...&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 表单验证反馈 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-atomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error-message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- JavaScript 动态插入错误信息，屏幕阅读器会在当前操作结束后朗读 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 紧急通知 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 等同于 aria-live=\"assertive\" + aria-atomic=\"true\"，立即打断当前朗读 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  系统将在 5 分钟后维护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 加载状态 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-busy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>正在加载...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>aria-live 值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>off（默认）</td>\n<td>不播报更新</td>\n<td>持续变化的数据（如股票行情）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>polite</td>\n<td>等当前朗读结束后播报</td>\n<td>表单验证、搜索结果数量、状态变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>assertive</td>\n<td>立即打断当前朗读</td>\n<td>错误提示、紧急通知、倒计时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键注意事项：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>aria-live</code> 区域必须在 DOM 加载时就存在，后续动态插入内容才会触发播报</li>\n<li>先渲染空的 <code>aria-live</code> 容器，再填充内容——而非动态创建整个容器</li>\n<li><code>aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;</code> 表示整个区域作为整体朗读（而非仅变化部分）</li>\n<li>过度使用 <code>assertive</code> 会严重干扰用户体验——大多数场景应使用 <code>polite</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"命名策略-aria-label-与-aria-labelledby-的选择\">命名策略：aria-label 与 aria-labelledby 的选择</h2><p><strong>使用 <code>aria-labelledby</code></strong> 当页面上已有可见文本可复用为名称：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;h2 id=&quot;cart-heading&quot;&gt;购物车 (3)&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;nav aria-labelledby=&quot;cart-heading&quot;&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cart-heading\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>购物车 (3)&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cart-heading\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用 <code>aria-label</code></strong> 当没有可见文本、或可见文本不够描述性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;button aria-label=&quot;关闭对话框&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;svg&gt;&lt;!-- X 图标 --&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/button&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"关闭对话框\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">svg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- X 图标 --></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">svg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用 <code>aria-describedby</code></strong> 提供补充说明（而非主名称）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;input type=&quot;password&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;pwd-hint&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;p id=&quot;pwd-hint&quot;&gt;密码需包含 8 位以上字符，含大小写字母和数字&lt;/p&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-describedby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pwd-hint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pwd-hint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>密码需包含 8 位以上字符，含大小写字母和数字&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见误用与诊断\">常见误用与诊断</h2><p><strong>误用一：冗余 ARIA。</strong> 给原生元素重复声明其隐含角色：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 冗余：&lt;nav&gt; 已隐含 role=&quot;navigation&quot; --&gt;&#10;&lt;nav role=&quot;navigation&quot;&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 正确：仅在需要区分多个同类 landmark 时加名称 --&gt;&#10;&lt;nav aria-label=&quot;主导航&quot;&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 冗余：&#x3C;nav> 已隐含 role=\"navigation\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"navigation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 正确：仅在需要区分多个同类 landmark 时加名称 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主导航\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>误用二：aria-hidden 与焦点冲突。</strong> 将 <code>aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;</code> 加在含可聚焦子元素的容器上——屏幕阅读器无法触达但键盘仍能聚焦，产生「幽灵焦点」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 错误：对话框背景内容用 aria-hidden 但未同步 inert --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;a href=&quot;/about&quot;&gt;关于我们&lt;/a&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- Tab 仍可聚焦 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 正确：使用 inert 属性（原生支持，2023+ 所有主流浏览器） --&gt;&#10;&lt;div inert&gt;&#10;  &lt;a href=&quot;/about&quot;&gt;关于我们&lt;/a&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 不可聚焦、不可交互、从可访问性树移除 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 错误：对话框背景内容用 aria-hidden 但未同步 inert --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/about\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>关于我们&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- Tab 仍可聚焦 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 正确：使用 inert 属性（原生支持，2023+ 所有主流浏览器） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/about\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>关于我们&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 不可聚焦、不可交互、从可访问性树移除 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>误用三：过度 aria-live。</strong> 对频繁变化的内容设置 <code>aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot;</code> 导致朗读风暴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ARIA 五大规则的核心：原生优先、ARIA 只补语义不加行为</li>\n<li>角色分三类：Landmark（页面结构）、Widget（交互控件）、Document Structure（文档结构）</li>\n<li>状态必须实时同步更新，遗忘更新是最常见 bug</li>\n<li>aria-live 区域需预渲染空容器，polite 优先于 assertive</li>\n<li><code>inert</code> 属性是 2026 年替代 <code>aria-hidden</code> + tabindex 管理的最佳方案</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇：<a href=\"keyboard-navigation-focus\">键盘导航与焦点管理</a>——ARIA 声明的语义需要键盘行为配合才完整</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../../frontend-state-machines-statecharts/statecharts/states-transitions\">前端状态机 — 状态与转换</a>——用状态机建模 ARIA 状态转换逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ARIA 角色、状态与属性实战","id":"aria-角色-状态与属性实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"角色的正确使用","id":"角色的正确使用"},{"level":2,"text":"状态管理的关键模式","id":"状态管理的关键模式"},{"level":2,"text":"aria-live 区域：动态内容播报","id":"aria-live-区域-动态内容播报"},{"level":2,"text":"命名策略：aria-label 与 aria-labelledby 的选择","id":"命名策略-aria-label-与-aria-labelledby-的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误用与诊断","id":"常见误用与诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"残障模型与用户需求全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/foundations/disability-models-user-needs"},"next":{"title":"键盘导航与焦点管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/keyboard-navigation-focus"}}